title: August 2024

@widow_pension
# prose-audit: Grade B — Czarzasty, the live President, ZUS offices and bereaved pensioners now ground both authority paths, and each credit choice retains a concrete organisational aftermath.
title: The widow's pension is signed
subtitle: A Left demand becomes a household entitlement
